WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.712
Emperor Kangxi cared deeply about the lives of the people in the south.

00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:06.523
He traveled south by boat along the canal several times.

00:00:06.523 --> 00:00:10.575
People along the way vied to see the emperor's boat.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.993
He went in person to inspect the Yellow River dike works.

00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:17.303
Only if the river waters were calm could the people live in peace.

00:00:17.774 --> 00:00:21.344
After the works were completed, the river flowed obediently.

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:25.503
He walked into a bustling market and chatted with the vendors.

00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:28.823
He also visited academies to call on scholars.

00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:32.419
The scholars bowed in greeting and spoke of learning and people's livelihoods.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:35.487
The scholars' ideas benefited him greatly.

00:00:36.217 --> 00:00:39.063
Kangxi listened attentively, nodding and smiling from time to time.

00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:41.380
At night, he wrote inspection notes aboard the boat.

00:00:42.617 --> 00:00:45.037
Officials accompanied him and discussed flood-control plans.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.818
Outside the window, the moon was reflected on the surface of the canal.

00:00:50.318 --> 00:00:53.627
Water conservancy and transportation in Jiangnan also received greater attention.

00:00:54.374 --> 00:00:56.840
The people's lives grew more and more stable.
